flowchart LR
    %% Simplified Data Preprocessing Pipeline
    
    Start([Raw Data<br/>20,000 samples]) --> Clean["Data Cleaning<br/>• Handle missing values<br/>• Remove duplicates<br/>• Outlier detection"]
    
    Clean --> Separate["Feature Separation<br/>14 Numerical | 14 Categorical<br/>Target: 34 job roles"]
    
    Separate --> Numerical["Numerical Pipeline<br/>Standard Scaler<br/>z = (x - μ) / σ"]
    Separate --> Categorical["Categorical Pipeline<br/>One-Hot Encoding<br/>→ 63 features"]
    
    Numerical --> Combine["Merge Features<br/>Total: 77 dimensions"]
    Categorical --> Combine
    
    Combine --> Balance["Class Balancing<br/>Random Oversampling<br/>→ 37,808 samples"]
    
    Balance --> Split["Train-Test Split<br/>80/20 Stratified<br/>Train: 30,246 | Test: 7,562"]
    
    Split --> Ready([Ready for Training])
    
    %% Styling
    style Start fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:3px
    style Clean fill:#fecaca,stroke:#ef4444,stroke-width:2px
    style Separate fill:#fed7aa,stroke:#f97316,stroke-width:2px
    style Numerical fill:#bbf7d0,stroke:#22c55e,stroke-width:2px
    style Categorical fill:#e9d5ff,stroke:#a855f7,stroke-width:2px
    style Combine fill:#fde68a,stroke:#eab308,stroke-width:2px
    style Balance fill:#c7d2fe,stroke:#818cf8,stroke-width:2px
    style Split fill:#bfdbfe,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:2px
    style Ready fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#22c55e,stroke-width:3px
